-- Q4: hospitalized due to a fall while traveling abroad; confirmation of the
-- wellness visit was given 8 months after the effective date. Hospitalization
-- month is not stated by the question, so it is set to 9 (after the belated
-- confirmation) so that the SS1.3 timeliness check is actually exercised rather
-- than shortcut by the "still pending" branch -- see NOTES.md.
q4 MEANS Claim WITH
    `agreement signed`                           IS TRUE
    `premium paid month`                         IS JUST 0
    `hospitalization month`                      IS 9
